msgid "The monitor will briefly disconnect while the layout changes."
msgstr "Il monitor si disconnetterà brevemente durante il cambio del layout."

#: crates/sumi-gui/qml/Store.qml:372 crates/sumi-gui/qml/Store.qml:387
msgid "Switch USB host"
msgstr "Cambia host USB"

#: crates/sumi-gui/qml/Store.qml:372 crates/sumi-gui/qml/Store.qml:387
msgid ""
"Peripherals on the monitor's USB hub (keyboard, mouse…) will move to the "
